  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index defines actions but records no completed action.",
    "The first candidate action is checklist execution, which becomes ready only after structural validation tasks complete.",
    "Metis deformity and initial Gift resolution use explicit source-review, decision, and reconciliation actions.",
    "Completing initial Gift identity actions does not enable additional Gift purchase or runtime Gift execution.",
    "Chronicle owns action discovery, dispatch validation, dependency enforcement, evidence checks, staleness propagation, diagnostics, fingerprints, and promotion integration.",
    "Assigned action owners remain responsible for substantive source review, decisions, reconciliation, and evidence production."
  ]
